2026-07-26T10:40:33.7378878Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-26T10:40:33.7448758Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-26T10:40:33.7449359Z i /tmp/RtmpOIgkbX/duckdb
2026-07-26T10:40:33.7449689Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-26T10:40:33.7450067Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-26T10:40:33.7450830Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-26T10:40:33.7451679Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-26T10:40:33.7452452Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-26T10:40:33.7453358Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-26T10:40:33.7717646Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-26T10:40:33.7834996Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-26T10:40:33.8299190Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-26T10:40:33.8469822Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
